{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape Be Gunned!</strong> is an incremental game about shooting shapes with a variety of guns!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an active incremental gameplay about shooting shapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shoot up to 9 different guns at the same time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >choose between dozens of weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weapon types include: bullets, lasers and magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >upgrade your weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an incremental game with an ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >includes an &quot;auto&quot; mode that doesn't require active aiming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >minimalist pixel art about basic shapes like squares and triangles</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971350?t=1761761527","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971350?t=1761761527","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971350/666e76d583f857a22d7ba4d15a3783c840608869/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761761527","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971350/666e76d583f857a22d7ba4d15a3783c840608869/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761761527","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape Be Gunned!</strong> is an incremental game about shooting shapes with a variety of guns!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an active incremental gameplay about shooting shapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shoot up to 9 different guns at the same time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragrap